            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Séance 0.3.37

The servers a chat starts now appear under Live Servers in its side panel, whether or not the agent published them, with whether each is still running. Servers on a connected computer's chats are listed too, and open through that computer. Settings → Devices → This Mac can turn this off.

With iPhone build 98, New Chat on the phone and iPad is redone in the sidebar's look.
]]></description>
